#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_415.rst:16
msgid "Breaking Changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_415.rst:19
msgid "Changes for set() method in BaseBuilder and Model class"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_415.rst:21
msgid ""
"The casting for the ``$value`` parameter has been removed to fix a bug "
"where passing parameters as array and string to the ``set()`` method were"
" handled differently. If you extended the ``BaseBuilder`` class or "
"``Model`` class yourself and modified the ``set()`` method, then you need"
" to change its definition from ``public function set($key, ?string $value"
" = '', ?bool $escape = null)`` to ``public function set($key, $value = "
"'', ?bool $escape = null)``."
msgstr ""

